{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"db0c2f75408a2b23","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nTrans people deserve tools, language, and spaces that are created with them in mind, not simply adapted for them after the fact.","x":334,"y":-172,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4e86628d0c38f503","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Affirm and support trans people\n- Create a product that speaks directly to a smaller, underserved community\n- Provide resources beyond the planner\n- Help trans people feel thought about and cared for\n- Inspire confidence, comfort, and self-acceptance","x":334,"y":-42,"width":446,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"525dd4f2d9309781","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- Trans adults\n- Trans youth\n- Parents and families of trans kids\n- LGBTQ+ community organizations\n- Allies\n- Schools, nonprofits, and resource groups","x":340,"y":280,"width":434,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6d8c196c51bf8ede","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Purchase or use the planner\n- Follow social media for resources\n- Learn how to support the trans community\n- Share resources with trans youth and families\n- Attend or promote workshops\n- Engage with name change resources and community support","x":874,"y":-37,"width":519,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6a3d6fa5ef639966","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Affirmation posts\n- Planner page previews\n- Trans resource guides\n- Name change workshop information\n- Support tips for allies\n- Community resource spotlights\n- Stories of affirmation and identity\n- Mental wellness and self-reflection prompts","x":1500,"y":-70,"width":463,"height":317,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3e6dd28ac78a7e92","type":"text","text":"# Transcend\n","x":114,"y":-32,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ec593af446424af0","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nMusic is more than entertainment. It is a tool for connection, education, representation, and community-building.","x":363,"y":-960,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"83ed50a6eb424395","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Give underrepresented artists a platform\n- Share underground and queer music\n- Inspire people to explore music more deeply\n- Build community through sound, education, and shared experiences","x":363,"y":-815,"width":400,"height":255,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a6982629e4c9592c","type":"text","text":"# Music Services\n","x":114,"y":-810,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"17151b951ae241a8","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Listen to the catalogue\n- Book DJ services\n- Explore underground and queer artists\n- Attend events\n- Support the community\n- Deepen their understanding of music and other people","x":874,"y":-812,"width":519,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fe42627b61acb8b4","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Artist spotlights\n- Queer and underground music recommendations\n- DJ set clips\n- Music education posts\n- Event recaps\n- “Songs you should know” series\n- Behind-the-scenes of production or performance","x":1500,"y":-824,"width":463,"height":275,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"dbfa7dd47c92e42a","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nHealthy living should be accessible, community-driven, and rooted in real knowledge, real ingredients, and real personal experience.","x":334,"y":600,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"5889f3047a186690","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Promote healthier food and drink options\n- Share knowledge about vitamins, nutrients, and wellness\n- Support small businesses and food vendors\n- Connect personal stories with practical nutrition\n- Make healthier lifestyles feel accessible","x":334,"y":730,"width":446,"height":255,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"4e255ba7c757a24c","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Try the drinks\n- Learn more about personal nutrition\n- Support small businesses in the community\n- Engage with wellness education\n- See food and drink as part of a healthier lifestyle","x":874,"y":735,"width":519,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"af0e7d7df9b92300","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Juice ingredient breakdowns\n- Benefits of specific vitamins and nutrients\n- Personal wellness story posts\n- Small business/vendor collaborations\n- “What’s in this drink?” educational posts\n- Healthy lifestyle tips\n- Community market or pop-up announcements","x":1500,"y":702,"width":463,"height":317,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9446aeef402dd3c9","type":"text","text":"# Sweet Glens\n","x":114,"y":740,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b1416854f78fa2f4","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- People interested in healthier drinks\n- Food vendors\n- Small business owners\n- Wellness-focused customers\n- Community members seeking better nutrition\n- People with digestive or lifestyle-related health concerns","x":317,"y":1052,"width":480,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d712cd58d3853fd9","type":"text","text":"# Dai's Brand Ecosystem","x":-324,"y":-177,"width":233,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"be15c37a21e22c3c","type":"text","text":"**COMMUNITY**\nEach project is built around supporting people, especially underrepresented communities.\n\n**REPRESENTATION**\nThe work gives visibility to queer, trans, underground, creative, and wellness-focused communities.\n\n**EDUCATION**\nEach brand teaches something: music discovery, personal nutrition, or community support.\n\n**WELLNESS**\nWellness appears in different forms across the ecosystem: emotional wellness, physical wellness, cultural wellness, and community wellness.\n\n**SELF-EXPRESSION**\nMusic, food, identity, and creativity, helping people express who they are.","x":-520,"y":-72,"width":429,"height":532,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"10f1acab5e81e758","type":"text","text":"## Music Services + Transcend\n\n**Shared connection:** Queer visibility, affirmation, community events, and cultural representation.\n\nOverlap:\n\n- Queer-centered events\n- Fundraisers for trans resources\n- Music events connected to Transcend campaigns\n- Playlists for affirmation, identity, and healing\n- Community nights featuring queer and trans artists\n\n## Music Services + Sweet Glen’s\n\n**Shared connection:** Events, community gathering, local business support, and lifestyle culture.\n\nOverlap:\n\n- Pop-ups with music and drinks\n- Wellness-focused community events\n- Vendor markets\n- Music + juice experiences\n- Events that support small businesses and artists\n\n## Sweet Glen’s + Transcend\n\n**Shared connection:** Care, support, wellness, and resource-building.\n\nOverlap:\n\n- Wellness resources for LGBTQ+ communities\n- Community care events\n- Nutrition and self-care content\n- Fundraisers or pop-ups supporting trans youth\n- Partnerships with LGBTQ+ wellness groups","x":2120,"y":-433,"width":473,"height":1042,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3818e230877ced9e","type":"text","text":"This brand system uses music, wellness, and affirmation to support underrepresented communities through culture, care, education, and self-expression.","x":-700,"y":-340,"width":437,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"72cfb4e3ff91bff5","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- Music lovers\n- Queer communities\n- Underground music fans\n- Event organizers\n- Artists and creatives\n- People interested in music education and discovery","x":344,"y":-480,"width":438,"height":260,"color":"6"}
	],
